\]

The global Sections 122--123 detour/payment currencies remain
\[
\liminf {1\over D}\sum_r(L_r+P_{{\rm exc},r}-2d_r)
\ge {\pi\over2}(2-\sqrt3),
\qquad
\sum_rP_{{\rm exc},r}\le10(e_{BB}-k).
